[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "text": "You mean your best friend, "
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "text": "the shopkeeper?"
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "text": "Sylvia, I want to make a deal."
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "text": "I'll conquer the rankings--"
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "text": "fight whoever it takes."
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "text": "And in return,"
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "text": "You find me the assholes who"
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "text": "killed Bishop."
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "text": "Calm down...  "
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "text": "You shouldn't make this personal. "
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "text": "It's the quickest way to "
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "text": "lose a battle."
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "text": "This isn't a battle anymore... "
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "text": "It's a motherfucking war!"
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "text": "Fine..."
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "text": "It makes no difference, really."
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "text": "The mastermind behind Bishop's "
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "text": "death is the owner of Pizza Bat."
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "text": "This building..."
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "text": "Most of this city... "
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "text": "He is the head of the corporation"
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "text": "that runs it all."
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "text": "Jasper Batt, Jr. "
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "text": "And as fate would have it, he's also "
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "text": "the number one assassin."
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "text": "You better not be lyin'."
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "text": "It is a fact."
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "text": "The object of your revenge is "
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "text": "waiting at the top of the ranks. "
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "text": "Wonderfully convenient, "
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "text": "don't you think?"
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "text": "Sure is."
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "text": "There's a new hotel on the beach."
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "text": "The 50th ranked assassin is "
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "text": "waiting for you there."
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "text": "By the way, Batt, Jr. "
  },
  {
    "id": 36,
    "text": "owns that hotel, too."
  },
  {
    "id": 37,
    "text": "He really is everywhere,"
  },
  {
    "id": 38,
    "text": "huh?"
  },
  {
    "id": 39,
    "text": "Better hurry. "
  },
  {
    "id": 40,
    "text": "There are 50 other fighters"
  },
  {
    "id": 41,
    "text": "trying to kill him."
  },
  {
    "id": 42,
    "text": "You have no time to waste."
  },
  {
    "id": 43,
    "text": "Just sit back, Sylvia, "
  },
  {
    "id": 44,
    "text": "and watch the hell "
  },
  {
    "id": 45,
    "text": "I'm gonna raise!"
  }
]